Distribution
------------

On 2026-09-23 Amiga Corporation approved distributing the Commodore Amiga
binaries that this project builds on; the project reads this as lifting the
restriction on releasing Amiga UNIX to the public. This repository carries no
Amiga or Amiga UNIX binaries. The install media built with it are published as
release files on amigaux.org, never through this repository.

Third-party material in this repository
---------------------------------------

src/tz/tzdata.zi
  The IANA Time Zone Database, version 2026c (https://www.iana.org/time-zones),
  in the public domain.

src/setclk/setclk-y2k.patch
  A patch to the stock Amix 2.1 setclk.c (Commodore's source, amigasrc-2.1
  package): its context lines are Commodore's. It consolidates the two
  community Y2K fixes by Piru (2006) and a_petri (2007), as collected at
  https://www.amigaunix.com/doku.php/y2k-dst, credited in the patch header.

src/miniroot/profile
  Replaces the stock /etc/profile on the install miniroot and keeps the stock
  banner and Ctrl-C trap (a few lines of Commodore's text).
